From fc21526058d86db077f691579aa1d16d78b0fa2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: omesh <roland@nordhain.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 10:03:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] feat: all modifications - fast crypto + increased
 limits + Ledger fix

- curve25519-dalek via C FFI (1.65x faster wallet scanning)
- Increased block batch limits (10000 blocks, 20MB)
- Ledger PAC fix for macOS 26+ (dispatch HID to main thread)
- .gitignore for Rust build artifacts

Author: Roland Kohlhuber
